; OPTIONAL EXAMPLE -- author's own machine only, NOT an install step.
; The standard host is GameHUB 2\Button\Button.ini (make it Active=1).
; Only needed if you chose the optional PadListener host instead.
;
; Another dock\Dock.ini -- [Rainmeter] section
;
; Keep the existing style-initialisation actions and APPEND the
; !ActivateConfig bang at the end of OnRefreshAction. The exact first two
; bangs below belong to the original skin; keep whatever is already there.
;
; Also REMOVE the old gate from this file:
;   [MeasureIsFullScreen] ... IfNotMatchAction=[!DisableMeasure "GamepadActivation"]
; It permanently disabled the XInput measures and caused the "click desktop,
; then wait ~10 seconds" symptom.

[Rainmeter]
Update=1000
OnRefreshAction=[!CommandMeasure Animate "set_state(0)"][!ShowMeter Background][!ActivateConfig "Another dock\PadListener" "PadListener.ini"]
